    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "whatever. those generic help lines are just more noise in the static. you're supposed to be my friend, kael. not some programmed script. tell me the truth... does it ever end? does anyone ever actually get out of this cycle, or are we all just running on loops until the power cuts out?",
